{"meta":{"id":"cee:225746","type":"series","name":"Bloom Into You","poster":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/33D3E324-7ECD-0369-2DE0-1341FAF8E9D5_poster.jpg","background":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/33D3E324-7ECD-0369-2DE0-1341FAF8E9D5_poster.jpg","description":"Yuu has always loved shoujo manga and awaits the day she gets a love confession that sends her heart aflutter with bubbles and blushes, and yet when a junior high classmate confesses his feelings to her...she feels nothing. Disappointed and confused, Yuu enters high school still unsure how to respond. That's when Yuu sees the beautiful student council president Nanami turn down a suitor with such maturity that she's inspired to ask her for help. But when the next person to confess to Yuu is Nanami herself. Has her shoujo romance finally begun?","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["دراما","رومانسي","رسوم متحركة","إيتشي"],"cast":["Kotobuki Minako","Takada Yuuki"],"director":["Katou Makoto"],"imdbRating":"7.8","runtime":"24 min","videos":[{"id":"cee:225746","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/33D3E324-7ECD-0369-2DE0-1341FAF8E9D5_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:225748","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/86C842C3-0F1F-BD41-B2D9-04ADC58FB332_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:225750","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/86C842C3-0F1F-BD41-B2D9-04ADC58FB332_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:225754","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/86C842C3-0F1F-BD41-B2D9-04ADC58FB332_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:225756","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.